## 🚀 How to Run

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/chest_xray_classification
cd chest_xray_classification
pip install tensorflow keras matplotlib scikit-learn pillow
jupyter notebook
```

Download dataset from:
👉 https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/paultimothymooney/chest-xray-pneumonia

